OL,3,GNEWSALocals claim #200m scheme is
OL,4,A'rattling' homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents living near a #200m roadworks
OL,7,Fscheme say their homes are being
OL,8,Frattled by vibrations caused by heavy
OL,9,Fmachinery, which is causing cracks in
OL,10,Ftheir walls.
OL,12,FMatt Raven, of Cantley Lane South near
OL,13,FNorwich, Norfolk, said his house
OL,14,F"moved" when the tremors were at their
OL,15,Fstrongest and he had filmed his kitchen
OL,16,Fcupboards vibrating.
OL,18,FThe Thickthorn scheme, approved last
OL,19,Fyear, is intended to speed up journey
OL,20,Ftimes in the area with the creation of
OL,21,Ftwo new underpasses beneath the A47 and
OL,22,FA11 - and a bridge over the A11.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
