OL,3,GNEWSALocals claim #200m scheme is
OL,4,A'rattling' homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesman for National Highways said:
OL,7,F"As work progresses, our contractor
OL,8,Fcontinues to actively monitor noise and
OL,9,Fvibrations to ensure we adhere to
OL,10,Fconstruction guidelines."
